#%RAML 1.0 DataType
description: |
  Status of an order's dispatch note.
  - PENDING, SIGNED and REJECTED: the logistics folder where the file is.
  - ON_HOLD: the order has no dispatch note because it is waiting for stock.
  - UNKNOWN: logistics did not respond.
type: string
enum: [PENDING, SIGNED, REJECTED, ON_HOLD, UNKNOWN]
example: REJECTED
